  "2026-11-15T16:07:36.325Z",codex-sol,"Only test (22) and test (26) are required; CodeQL gets the requested docs/tracker/lockfile filters and keeps its weekly schedule. Retain explicit project extension installation for strict health and SDK adoption differential on code PR Node 26/deep. Main run 43638869967: wall 493s/488s for Node 22/26, full npm gates 70s/99s and repeated Bun gates 68s/96s. Slowest model sequence ~34s. No lint script exists. Docs path retains identity audit, doc-consuming suites, pack dry-run and both release verifiers; no verifier/release file is edited."
  "2026-11-15T16:08:33.252Z",codex-sol,"Correction to baseline wall notation: Node 22 is 553s (9m13s), Node 26 is 488s (8m08s). Earlier 493s for Node 22 was a transcription error; raw job timestamps were 20:42:00 to 20:51:13 UTC."
  "2026-11-15T16:10:59.772Z",codex-sol,"Typecheck, test typecheck and docstring gate passed; linked static checks passed in 4.988s. Touched quick suites passed 29 tests, zero failures, 28.218s. All 26 schema/reference cells remain exercised; generated allowed/required-refused/CLI-refused totals are derived from testDepth(512), not seeded starting counts. No elapsed-time product assertion is scaled; the only testTime use is the worker harness test timeout evaluated before spawning. Strict YAML/timeout validation passed; actionlint is unavailable. Quick coverage remains running under its twenty-minute watchdog."
